<h1 style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #00539b; font-size: 26px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center">STATE OF THE CITY: SOUTH SIDE COMMUNITY NIGHT</h1>
<h2 style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #d3222a; font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center">Tuesday, April 11, 2023<br>6:00PM - 7:30PM<br>Marion Franklin Community Center<br>2801 Lockbourne Road, Columbus, OH 43207</h2>
<p class="gd_p" style="text-align: start; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="start">Mayor Andrew J. Ginther invites you to attend the State of the City: South Side Community Night as he shares accomplishments and future initiatives in your neighborhood. Please join us for dinner and an opportunity to speak with the Mayor and city department representatives.</p>
<p class="gd_p" style="text-align: start; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="start">Watch the 2023 State of the City address on <a href="https://youtu.be/e4rNmT5net8?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Youtube</a> or read the <a href="https://www.columbus.gov/Templates/Detail.aspx?id=2147529589&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">transcript</a>.</p>
